  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0604_T26_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "...\r",
        "You again?\r",
        "There’s no need to be alert.\n",
        "I don’t bother with wimps like you.\r",
        "Speaking of weaklings, the city’s\n",
        "Gym Leader isn’t here, and\f",
        "is supposedly taking care of a\f",
        "sick Pokémon at the Lighthouse.\r",
        "Humph! Boo-hoo!\n",
        "Just let sick Pokémon go!\r",
        "A Pokémon that can’t battle\n",
        "is worthless!\r",
        "Why don’t you go train at\n",
        "the Lighthouse?\r",
        "Who knows? It may make you a bit\n",
        "of a better Trainer!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0604_T26_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Dark roads are dangerous at night.\r",
        "But, in the pitch-black night,\n",
        "the sea is even more treacherous!\r",
        "Without the beacon of the Lighthouse\n",
        "to guide her, no ship can sail."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0604_T26_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "That thing you have--\n",
        "it’s a Pokégear, right?\f",
        "Wow, that’s cool."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0604_T26_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Wow, you have a Pokémon!\n",
        "That is just so awesome."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0604_T26_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "You, young Trainer!\n",
        "The sea is sweet!\r",
        "Sing with me!\f",
        "The sea is blue!\n",
        "The sea is salty!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0604_T26_00005",
      "en_US": [
